   'An elegant white satin challah cover, 48×58 cm, embroidered with "Pote''ach et Yadecha" and "Shabbat and Yom Tov", with the "Hamotzi" blessing. It gives the Shabbat and holiday table a luxurious, festive look and adds holiness and beauty to any occasion. Perfect as a gift!',
