   'An elegant white challah cover made of quality leather-look material with "Shabbat and Yom Tov" embroidered in gentle relief. The corners are decorated with silver studs that create a sparkling, impressive look. A perfect addition to the Shabbat and holiday table, combining modern design with tradition.',
