   'An elegant challah cover in champagne leather look, decorated with a geometric frame embroidered in silver thread and "Shabbat and Yom Tov" at the centre. A delicate, minimalist design that gives the Shabbat table special charm, suitable as a gift or for everyday use for many years.',
