   'An elegant leather-look challah bag in white and bronze with a zip, 35 cm high, perfect for a festive Shabbat table. Decorated with "Shabbat and Yom Tov" embroidery and an elegant olive-leaf pattern. A luxurious storage solution that keeps the challot fresh and adds a touch of beauty to every meal.',
