   'An elegant challah cover in luxurious velvet, 42×52 cm, decorated with "In honour of Shabbat and Yom Tov" and verses from "Eshet Chayil". It adds a touch of holiness and beauty to the Shabbat table. A perfect gift for any Jewish home.',
